=AntiAircraft Tower=
*Based on [[units/turrets/AntiAircraft|AntiAircraft]] turret
*  Health: 10
*  Price: %Minerals% 50
*  [[concepts/scanning range|Scanning range]]: 2 [=4-2 (tower modifier)]
*  [[concepts/attack range|Hrz. Attack range]]: 7 [=5+2 (bonus)] (AAMissile)
*  Does not require ammunition
*  1 attack per round
*  Explosion radius: 1
*  Damage: 10
This tower-turret type can detect and attack sub-orbital planes in flight.
The AntiAircraft tower-turret intercepts hostile mobile units during their movement [[concepts/phase]] even if itself mounted on a mobile unit. It is thus particularly well suited to establish an adhoc defense perimeter, or to persistently defend strategically important regions if mounted on a tower.
